! Kinetic modeling and experimental study of laminar burning velocities of CH4/NH3/N2O/Ar premixed flames
! Chemical kinetic mechanism.
! CH4 oxidation was selected from GRI-Mech 3.0 and the further updated vesion by Hong et al. (Proc. Combust. Inst. 33 (2011) 309-316), and Okarfor et al. (Combust. Flame 187 (2018) 185-198).
! NOx sub-mechanism was selected from Zhang-Mech (Combust. Flame 182 (2017) 122-141).
! NH3 oxidation (excluding NOx sub-mechanism) was developed based on Han-Mech (Combust. Flame 213 (2020) 1-13).
! C-N interaction was selected from Konnov-Mech (Proc. Combust. Inst., 2021, 38: 805-812) and GRI-Mech 3.0.
! Methylamine subset was extracted from the work P. Glarborg et al. : Oxidation of methylamine, Int. J. Chem. Kinet. 52 (2020) 893-906.


ELEMENTS
O  H  C  N  AR
END

SPECIES

H2      H       O       O2      OH      H2O     HO2     H2O2    
C       CH      CH2     CH2(S)  CH3     CH4     CO      CO2     
HCO     CH2O    CH2OH   CH3O    CH3OH   C2H     C2H2    C2H3    
C2H4    C2H5    C2H6    HCCO    CH2CO   HCCOH   N       NH      
NH2     NH3     NNH     NO      NO2     N2O     HNO     CN      
HCN     H2CN    HCNN    HCNO    HOCN    HNCO    NCO     N2      
AR      C3H7    C3H8    CH2CHO  CH3CHO  
HONO   HNO2   NO3    HON  HNO3  HONO2  
N2H2    N2H3   N2H4    H2NO   H2NN   
HNC     NCN     HNCN  HCNH 
CH3NH2  CH3NH  CH2NH2  CH2NH  

END

REACTIONS

